		(descr "Adafruit PCF8575 I2C 16-GPIO Expander Breakout (PID 5904). Board 1.60 x 0.70 in (40.64 x 17.78 mm), 4 corner mounting holes on 1.40 x 0.50 in spacing (35.56 x 12.70 mm). Two 12-pin 0.1 in header rows. STEMMA QT connectors on the breakout are NOT represented -- user is installing via the two 0.1 in header strips included with the breakout. All on-board pull-ups (10K on SDA/SCL), bypass caps, on-LED, and address jumpers live on the breakout module and do not need to be represented on the parent PCB.")
